    "title": "pandas.io.parsers.TextFileReader.close — pandas 3.1.0.dev0 documentation",
    "status": 200,
    "markdown": "# pandas.io.parsers.TextFileReader.close#\n\n- TextFileReader.close()[source]#\n- Close the underlying file handle and parser engine. Called automatically when the `TextFileReader` is used as a context\nmanager.See also \n  - `TextFileReader.read`\n  - Read rows from the file into a DataFrame.\n  - `TextFileReader.get_chunk`\n  - Read the next chunk of rows.\n Examples >>> reader = pd.read_csv(\"data.csv\", chunksize=5) >>> reader.close()",
